msgstr "已用"

msgid ""
"When RAM is full the kernel may kill applications. Enable disk swap for a "
"reliable safety net."
msgstr "当内存已满时，内核可能会终止应用程序。启用磁盘交换以提供可靠的安全网。"

msgid "Zram"
msgstr "压缩内存段"

msgid "Zram Devices"
msgstr "Zram 设备"

msgid "Zram and Zswap are both active"
msgstr "Zram 和 Zswap 均已激活"

msgid ""
"Zram and Zswap are mutually exclusive — each creates its own compressed RAM "
"pool. Running both wastes CPU and can cause severe memory thrashing. Disable "
"one of them."
msgstr ""
"Zram 和 Zswap 互斥——各自创建独立的压缩内存池。同时运行两者会浪费 CPU 资源并可"
"能导致严重的内存抖动。请禁用其中一个。"

msgid "Zswap"
msgstr "压缩交换缓存"

msgid "default"
msgstr "默认"

msgid ""
"lz4 = fast (recommended), zstd = best ratio, lzo = legacy. Changing requires "
"zswap restart."
msgstr ""
"lz4 = 快速（推荐），zstd = 最佳压缩率，lzo = 旧版。更改需要重启 zswap。"

msgid "range"
msgstr "范围"

msgid "seconds"
msgstr "秒"

msgid "with Zram"
msgstr "已启用 Zram"

msgid "with Zram active — prefer fast compressed RAM over disk cache"
msgstr "已启用 Zram — 优先使用快速压缩的 RAM 而非磁盘缓存"

